-\left(  2\right)  \right)  }  &  \equiv\mathcal{B}_{1}\left(  \mathcal{H}%
^{2}\right)  _{2}=\ker\left\{  L_{2}^{1}\right\}  =\mathcal{B}_{1}\left(
