L_{2}^{0}\right\}  \ominus\ker\left\{  L_{2}^{1}\right\}  =\mathcal{B}%
_{1}\left(  \mathcal{H}^{2}\right)  _{\left(  0-1\right)  1d}\oplus
\mathcal{B}_{1}\left(  \mathcal{H}^{2}\right)  _{\left(  0-1\right)  0d}\\
