\ker\left\{  L_{2}^{1}\right\}  \right)  ^{\bot}=\operatorname{Ran}\left\{
\Gamma_{1}^{2}\right\}  \ominus\operatorname{Ran}\left\{  \Gamma_{0}%
^{2}\right\} \\
&  =\operatorname*{linspan}\left\{  \overset{}{\left\vert 12\right\rangle
