\mathcal{H}^{2}\right)  _{1}\oplus\mathcal{B}_{1}\left(  \mathcal{H}%
^{2}\right)  _{0}=\left(  \ker\left\{  L_{2}^{1}\right\}  \ominus\ker\left\{
L_{2}^{2}\right\}  \right)  \oplus\left(  \ker\left\{  L_{2}^{0}\right\}
\ominus\ker\left\{  L_{2}^{1}\right\}  \right) \\
