,\binom{4}{1}\mathbf{\Gamma}_{1}^{4},\binom{4}{2}\mathbf{\Gamma}_{2}%
^{4},\binom{4}{3}\mathbf{\Gamma}_{3}^{4},\binom{4}{4}\mathbf{\Gamma}_{4}%
^{4},0,0\right)  \left(
